s it you know so I texted to Carly  right away and I was like hey Jake oh  and made for you she's like what no it's  like it's the song we got it you just  got to hear it so she heard it and  agreed and then I did a show with Jake  at two weeks after I said hey man our  first dance is made for you it's gonna  be made for you he's like no way I said  yeah and then I was like don't shoot on  this chance like you know drunk because  he was up on it was up on our bus and I  was like maybe  maybe cool if you never gonna be that  guy that's like asking your friends come  work the wedding you know  Sasa a man be cool if you could maybe  you know coming and to do it and he's  like I've never been a wedding singer  he's like I'm totally and then I was  like awesome it just it worked out great  but it wasn't always easy coming to  agreement on every little detail with  both country stars telling us a few of  their struggles that came with planning  the big day ask her if I can get three  more people to the way when I talked to  Michael I said what question should I  ask Carly okay so his question is can he  have three more people come to the  wedding it's been difficult with sweet  Michael having a huge family and as we  go along I gave him a cutoff and as  we've gotten closer there's little  special people that just all of a sudden  is showing up that I have no idea who  they are but they're so important to it  right I'm pretty sure I granted you  those three people last week better not  be what I heard it's mostly her and her  mom they're planning at the wedding yeah  do they've got everything they've done  every day I have what cuz I have been  involved someo because I was like I  don't wanna be a dude it's like oh I  don't want to do I just don't want to  show up for the most part I just said we  have to have an open bar and we have to  make sure that my groomsmen attire is  simple if we just do like a other like I  got like an upscale restaurant look you  know good white shirt wow it's like we  get we can top it you know sir  they can serve yet servitude everything  I said we've I'm sorry asking some of my  buddies to start getting three-piece  suits so they're gonna be out here out  your day line you said he just wanted an  open bar and he wanted like simple  outfits for  i granted em both okay good but I mean  it sounds like they both got what they  wanted in the end right as for their  future they both know marriage has its  ups and downs especially with their busy  schedules we are not naive to think that  marriage will bring its abs and flows  and ups and downs and things like that  but at the end of the day I hope that in  50 years I can look at this person and  love him more than I do now which is a  whole lot but for now it's back to work  as Carly continues the fall portion on  Jason Aldean's ride all night tour with  Kane Brown and for Michael he's about to  headline CMT on tour this fall but come  December they'll be jetting off to the  sandals resort in Jamaica so or sure  this honeymoon will be worth the wait so  what did you think of their whimsical  Nashville wedding let us know in the  comments below  [Music]  [Music]
 

